      "text": "Saving Throw DC 14 Fortitude save\n\n---\n\nOnset 1 day\n\nStage 1 Stupefied 1 (3 days)\n\nStage 2 Stupefied 2 and Slowed 1 (1 day)\n\nStage 3 Paralyzed with spasms (1 day)\n\nStage 4 death"
